        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion BP-V6, American Relic Collection Flintlock Lever with Round El Tovar Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAs part of Fusion's American Relic Collection, the Flintlock Lever with El Tovar Round Rose is a great example of historic beauty when it is done right. The blending of classic shapes with just enough of a modern touch, makes this leverset perfect for traditional homes. It is available in antique relic pewter, medium relic bronze, and dark relic bronze finishes. The American Relic Collection Flintlock Lever with Round El Tovar Rose is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sandcasting</b> is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten brass is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Flintlock Lever with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Fusion BP-V6 Sandcast Flintlock Lever with El Tovar Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Flintlock Lever with El Tovar Round Rose, Fusion BP-V6",
                "description": "Fusion BP-V6, Flintlock Lever with El Tovar Round Rose - As part of Fusion's American Relic Collection, the Flintlock Lever with El Tovar Round Rose is a great example of historic beauty when it is done right. The blending of classic shapes with just enough of a modern touch, makes this leverset perfect for traditional homes. It is available in antique relic pewter, medium relic bronze, and dark relic bronze finishes. The American Relic Collection Flintlock Lever with Round El Tovar Rose is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.",
